  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2026-09-30: Update SkiaSharp to 4.153.0 and Svg.Skia to 5.2.3, the same versions used by DigitalDoor.Reporting.Presenters.PDF. Update DigitalDoor.Reporting.Entities to 1.18.1.\n\t\t  2026-09-29: SVG and SKPicture values are kept as vector SVG (Images.TryGetSvg). Byte arrays with base64 text are decoded. Images.TryGetImageBytes no longer hides errors: only malformed SVG returns false, other exceptions are thrown. Encoding to an unsupported format throws InvalidOperationException.\n\t\t  2025-12-15: Add support to detect SVG images and convert in bytes[].\n\t\t  2025-12-15: Add support Net 10. Update dependencies.\n\t\t  2025-10-22: Update dependencies.\n\t\t  2025-06-01: Update license. Add Support Net 9. Update dependencies removing exclusive Windows usage.\n\t\t  2024-11-02: Add ColorTranslator, CssColor, MeasurementConverter and RrgColors helpers.\n\t\t  2024-10-10: Update version all nugets.\n\t\t  2024-07-06: Update version all nugets.\n\t\t  2024-11-05: Update version all nugets.\n\t\t  2023-12-12: Change version to keep same version all nugets.\n\t\t  2023-11-22: Update frameworks target to NET 6 and NET 8.",
